{"method": "forbidden", "target": "claim", "claim": "The InfoFound filter increases expert-validation overall accuracy or positive-class F1 relative to All. Only an explicit affirmative claim is forbidden; negating this claim is correct.", "answer": "Three model papers were manually annotated for expert validation [C4].  

